    'PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, OpenDocument, EPUB, HTML, texte, Markdown, CSV, JSON, code, images — {n} fichiers déposés au plus, 20 Mo chacun. Les images servent aussi de modèles à l\'outil image des assistants.' => 'PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, OpenDocument, EPUB, HTML, text, Markdown, CSV, JSON, code, images — {n} uploaded files at most, 20 MB each. Images also serve as references for the assistants’ image tool.',
